category: Security
requires: cygwin libcrypt2 libtomcrypt1 libtommath zlib0
sdesc: "Relatively small SSH 2 server and client"
ldesc: "Dropbear is a relatively small SSH server and client. It runs on a variety of
POSIX-based platforms. Dropbear is open source software, distributed under a
MIT-style license. Dropbear is particularly useful for embedded-type Linux (or
other Unix) systems, such as wireless routers."

